I wouldn't wish for the Staff, but then again the only weapon that I
would wish for would be the Sceptre of Might, and even then only as a
lawful priest.

I just played a neutral valkyrie with the PYEC and was unimpressed.
Sure, it was nice to be able to recharge my wands of teleportation or
death, but recharging a wand from 1:0 to 2:3 is not all _that_ good.

I wouldn't go for the orb either because of weight issues and the fact
that it doesn't give MR.  I'd rather have a stack of cursed teleport
scrolls.

I've become convinced through my own experience and listening to folks
here that the key to ascending is getting MR, reflection, and poison
resistance as early as possible.

Therefore, I would vote for the Eye of the Aethiopica.  Benefits
include: faster energy regeneration meaning essentially unlimited
teleports for a much less monotonous game, MR, telepathy, a much
faster ascension run, a get-out-of-jail-free card, and a much easier
time wraith luring (not vegan, though :{ sorry).

